  "brain_first": "按原文查阅 Long Sentence Rescue 长难句拆解",
  "sort_order": 1071,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "目标不是画复杂语法树，而是把一句很长的英语拆成自己能读懂的几块。",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2819
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 先找主句主语：谁/什么是整句主角？",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2820
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 找主句谓语：这个主语真正“做什么/是什么”？",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2821
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 把介词短语先用括号括起来，例如 in the city, with his friends。",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2822
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 把定语从句括起来，例如 who/which/that 后面补充名词的信息。",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2823
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 把 doing/done/to do 非谓语块括起来。",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2824
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "6. 先只读主干“谁做什么”。",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2825
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "7. 再把修饰信息一块一块放回去。",
      "sourcePage": 105,
      "sourceIndex": 2826
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Example",
      "sourcePage": 106,
      "sourceIndex": 2827
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Students who regularly review new words in short sessions are more likely to remember them than",
      "sourcePage": 106,
      "sourceIndex": 2828
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "those trying to memorize a long list at once.",
      "sourcePage": 106,
      "sourceIndex": 2829
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Step 1 主干： Students are more likely to remember them.",
      "sourcePage": 106,
      "sourceIndex": 2830
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Step 2 定语从句： who regularly review new words in short sessions → 说明 students。",
      "sourcePage": 106,
      "sourceIndex": 2831
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Step 3 比较部分： than those... → 与另一类学生比较。",
      "sourcePage": 106,
      "sourceIndex": 2832
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Step 4 非谓语： trying to memorize... → 说明 those。",
      "sourcePage": 106,
      "sourceIndex": 2833
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "先读主干，再把这些信息加回来，就不需要逐字从左翻到右。",
      "sourcePage": 106,
      "sourceIndex": 2834
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "脑内第一句话：先找谁做什么，其他长东西先放旁边。",
      "sourcePage": 106,
      "sourceIndex": 2835
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
